<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY'S 1997/98 SOCCER SEASON BEGINS.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY'S 1997/98 SOCCER SEASON BEGINS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's 1997/98 first division soccer championship season began on Friday evening with a match between BVSC and Debrecen, which BVSC won 2-1 (2-0).</p>
<p>All other matches are being played Saturday.</p>
